Never kill a temple priest(ess) if you are going for armour class,
because they are peacefull your god will be angry and revoke your
AC bonus. If you can use a scroll of taming or a spell of charm monster.
Also it's only when you miss(fumble while pickpocketing) that you make
him/her angry, so if you can, get your dex to 18 or even 21(gloves of dex)
before attacking.
